WEBVTT

00:00.883 --> 00:03.510
Tell me what you parasites
came here to find.

00:04.303 --> 00:06.763
Like I'd ever tell you, scum.

00:06.805 --> 00:07.847
I see.

00:08.057 --> 00:11.393
Very well.
There are still two others.

00:11.435 --> 00:13.270
Only one of you fools
needs to be breathing

00:13.312 --> 00:14.646
to tell me what I need to hear.

00:14.730 --> 00:16.940
Your time has come… Now die!

00:22.404 --> 00:23.446
I hear footsteps…

00:23.572 --> 00:25.949
Someone is running outside
the confines of the mirror.

00:26.534 --> 00:29.620
Well, well, could your pals
have wised up and

00:29.662 --> 00:33.916
dumped you in favor of pursuing
their precious something?!

00:35.376 --> 00:38.212
The trail of sound is heading
toward the cave canem.

00:38.295 --> 00:39.754
There's no question.

00:39.838 --> 00:43.174
Fugo, you might as well
be six feet under now.

00:43.259 --> 00:44.927
I think I'll go snatch
that special something

00:44.969 --> 00:46.553
you're so keen on finding!

00:46.637 --> 00:48.889
Dammit, you bastard!

00:51.058 --> 00:53.435
<i>Abbacchio… Giorno…</i>

01:05.823 --> 01:08.659
Where is it?
Where is this key?

01:13.872 --> 01:15.748
There it is. That must be it.

01:19.086 --> 01:20.087
A mirror?

01:20.713 --> 01:22.506
No way this thing belongs
with the ruins.

01:23.549 --> 01:26.051
What is that? A key?

01:27.928 --> 01:28.720
What?

01:28.804 --> 01:30.013
Well, look at that.

01:30.097 --> 01:32.891
This is going to be like
taking candy from a baby.

01:32.975 --> 01:34.935
That's… It couldn't be…

01:35.311 --> 01:38.188
You can't unsee me, friend.

01:38.272 --> 01:42.109
The die is cast,
your fate is sealed!

01:54.330 --> 01:58.830
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

01:59.668 --> 02:03.171
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

02:04.923 --> 02:09.423
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

02:10.095 --> 02:13.932
<i>But I will never give in</i>

02:14.016 --> 02:18.516
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

02:25.778 --> 02:30.278
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

02:38.874 --> 02:43.374
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

02:44.838 --> 02:49.338
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

02:51.887 --> 02:55.056
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

02:55.099 --> 02:59.599
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

03:00.354 --> 03:04.854
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

03:14.576 --> 03:19.076
EPISODE 13
MIRROR MAN AND PURPLE SMOKE

03:16.704 --> 03:17.705
Sh-Shit!

03:19.581 --> 03:20.582
Bastard…

03:21.166 --> 03:23.626
I think I understand how this cazzo
messes with people's heads.

03:23.961 --> 03:26.254
So he's inside the mirror…

03:26.296 --> 03:28.923
And logically that can mean
only one thing.

03:29.466 --> 03:33.052
That coglione must've dragged
Fugo into the mirror,

03:33.595 --> 03:36.014
separating him from his Stand.

03:37.307 --> 03:39.851
It's a real shame,
but what counts now is that key!

03:42.521 --> 03:43.813
Just so you know,

03:43.897 --> 03:46.482
your breaking the mirror just made
my job that much easier, Abbacchio.

03:46.608 --> 03:49.652
Reflections act simply as portals
to the mirror world.

03:49.695 --> 03:52.531
By breaking it into pieces and
multiplying my points of entry,

03:52.614 --> 03:54.490
you might as well have handed me
your life on a silver platter!

03:54.783 --> 03:56.493
It's your lucky day…

03:56.660 --> 03:58.870
I grant you exclusive access
to my world,

03:58.954 --> 04:01.081
but only your physical self!

04:01.123 --> 04:04.084
Gotcha… You're not going anywhere.

04:04.334 --> 04:06.502
I'll be taking that key
off your hands, too!

04:08.464 --> 04:10.549
W-What?!

04:11.175 --> 04:15.095
You could only do this
with another Stand!

04:17.097 --> 04:18.807
I dragged you in here alone.

04:18.849 --> 04:22.060
There's no way you could
choke Mirror Man!

04:22.144 --> 04:25.355
Breaking that mirror wasn't
so disastrous, after all!

04:25.481 --> 04:27.357
It just means your view
of the outside world

04:27.399 --> 04:28.983
just got a whole lot narrower!

04:29.276 --> 04:31.152
You dragged something in here,
all right…

04:31.195 --> 04:32.696
Problem is, you can't see.

04:33.071 --> 04:34.530
Exclusive access…

04:35.115 --> 04:37.200
for my physical self only?!

04:37.284 --> 04:38.827
Th-That's…

04:40.329 --> 04:43.206
Grazie! Drag away, bastardo!
Knock yourself out!

04:43.290 --> 04:44.916
Moody Jazz!

04:48.128 --> 04:50.296
<i>Shit! That's a Stand!</i>

04:54.676 --> 04:56.177
Inside the mirror…

04:56.637 --> 04:58.972
So everything is
ass backwards.

04:59.014 --> 05:00.557
It'd be impossible to know.

05:00.641 --> 05:05.141
That is, until the bastard decides
to attack you with his Stand.

05:05.521 --> 05:08.148
Fugo must be in here, too.

05:08.190 --> 05:10.775
So how the hell do we
get out of this place?

05:11.360 --> 05:12.903
If I have to massacre you
to walk out of

05:12.945 --> 05:14.738
this dog and pony show,
then so be it.

05:15.072 --> 05:19.534
Why do you think
I recruited Moody Jazz?!

05:19.660 --> 05:22.954
So your power is an anthropomorphic
shape shifting Stand…

05:23.539 --> 05:25.999
You got me good, stronzo.

05:39.555 --> 05:43.767
When all is said and done,
your Stand is pretty damn feeble.

05:43.934 --> 05:45.560
So, unless you're fighting against
a total weakling,

05:45.602 --> 05:46.728
you don't stand a chance?

05:46.812 --> 05:50.190
Well, come on…
Get up and fight already!

05:51.066 --> 05:55.566
Listen, I already told you,
you're as good as dead.

05:56.905 --> 06:00.158
You managed to startle me slightly
when you showed up with that Stand,

06:00.242 --> 06:01.785
but you're still royally screwed!

06:01.994 --> 06:05.163
Guess I have to spell it out.
I'm crouching for a reason.

06:05.247 --> 06:07.290
I'm crouching because
I've no other choice!

06:07.416 --> 06:08.625
Well, that's obvious.

06:09.084 --> 06:10.418
You're crouched up like a fetus

06:10.460 --> 06:12.128
to give my foot
a clear path to your gut.

06:16.717 --> 06:20.554
I was crouching, so I could pick up
this shard of the mirror!

06:20.596 --> 06:23.265
Hey, why the bewildered face?

06:23.432 --> 06:24.850
Does this arm scare you?

06:24.933 --> 06:28.311
You of all people
should recognize it!

06:28.395 --> 06:32.895
I told you! Reflections serve
as portals to another world!

06:33.358 --> 06:36.152
So by using another piece of glass
to capture your reflection like so,

06:36.194 --> 06:38.070
I've got myself another portal!

06:38.322 --> 06:39.614
Do you get it now?

06:39.656 --> 06:41.991
I dragged something special into
this mirror world…

06:42.075 --> 06:43.785
Your stinking arm, stronzo!

06:45.621 --> 06:48.206
Now we wouldn't want you
to get too excited,

06:48.290 --> 06:51.584
so only half your body
was allowed entrance.

06:51.793 --> 06:53.211
As for your Stand,

06:53.420 --> 06:55.839
I'll be a nice guy
and grant half of it exit!

06:56.423 --> 06:59.509
Now I've got you and your Stand
exactly where I want them!

06:59.801 --> 07:01.761
The key's mine!

07:02.971 --> 07:05.306
<i>Shit, there goes
that freakin' key.</i>

07:05.390 --> 07:08.684
<i>That means not only did
I botch the mission…</i>

07:08.810 --> 07:12.271
<i>It means all that shit that Giorno
predicted is about to come true!</i>

07:12.439 --> 07:13.648
<i>Not on my watch!</i>

07:13.690 --> 07:16.693
<i>We're going to solve this mystery,
save Fugo, and defeat the enemy!</i>

07:16.735 --> 07:19.529
<i>That's how we're all going to
get out of this alive!</i>

07:19.821 --> 07:23.991
<i>Dammit, I might be down,
but I still have my pride!</i>

07:24.743 --> 07:27.287
<i>He's not getting
that damn key!</i>

07:27.579 --> 07:31.207
<i>I swear on all that is holy,
I, Leone Abbacchio,</i>

07:31.249 --> 07:33.334
<i>will never give up this key!</i>

07:37.965 --> 07:40.175
I admit most of
Mirror Man's energy

07:40.217 --> 07:43.595
is spent on dragging fools like you
into the nether realm,

07:43.679 --> 07:45.263
so that doesn't leave much in terms
of brute fighting strength.

07:45.347 --> 07:46.973
I am well aware of my talents!

07:47.057 --> 07:50.060
But when I have you
in this position,

07:50.102 --> 07:53.605
I don't exactly need to be
a super hero to off you instantly!

07:53.939 --> 07:55.523
In fact,
a four-year-old could easily

07:55.565 --> 07:57.400
slide this shard down your gullet,

07:57.442 --> 07:58.818
and it would be
nighty night for good.

07:59.069 --> 08:00.361
Victory is so sweet…

08:00.612 --> 08:02.989
Grazie Mille for showing me
exactly where to find the—

08:11.206 --> 08:14.626
Whatcha waiting for?
Hurry up and do it!

08:15.210 --> 08:17.295
What the hell are
you doing, Abbacchio?!

08:17.421 --> 08:19.381
Think you can hide it from me?!

08:19.673 --> 08:21.424
If you can move that
pathetic body at all,

08:21.466 --> 08:23.551
it will only be
a paltry amount at best!

08:23.593 --> 08:25.678
It'll be obvious, get it?!

08:25.721 --> 08:26.888
Hide?

08:27.139 --> 08:28.723
What are you talking about?

08:28.765 --> 08:30.933
Hide what where?

08:37.899 --> 08:40.443
Cazzo, the jig is up.

08:40.569 --> 08:42.028
Show me that damn hand now!

08:45.574 --> 08:48.159
Come clean now, you dirty bastardo!

08:48.910 --> 08:50.786
Did you lose something?

08:51.413 --> 08:55.583
Ever find that thing
you were looking for? Well?

08:55.792 --> 08:58.461
<i>Why would he do something
like that?</i>

08:58.920 --> 09:01.672
<i>Shit, if he really did
chop off his hand,</i>

09:02.466 --> 09:05.177
<i>then his Stand's hand
outside the mirror is…</i>

09:05.969 --> 09:07.136
<i>It can't be…</i>

09:09.222 --> 09:10.640
<i>Its hand is gone!</i>

09:10.682 --> 09:11.683
<i>Miseria…</i>

09:12.267 --> 09:14.435
<i>I-It has the key!</i>

09:15.228 --> 09:16.979
<i>And it's going back!</i>

09:18.648 --> 09:23.148
Shit, and that new guy Giorno
was just around the corner!

09:24.279 --> 09:26.656
He chopped off that hand
to give him the key?!

09:26.698 --> 09:28.991
Guess you should have dug
that piece of glass into my gullet

09:29.034 --> 09:30.618
when you had the chance.

09:30.952 --> 09:34.538
Then my Stand's hand would
have dropped dead in its tracks.

09:37.793 --> 09:41.087
Whoopsie, too bad…
Close, but no cigar.

09:41.129 --> 09:44.298
That, my friend, is the sound
of your dreams disintegrating.

09:44.549 --> 09:46.592
He'll pick up that key
any second!

09:49.429 --> 09:51.472
<i>You really are
a shape shifting bastardo!</i>

09:51.598 --> 09:54.726
<i>You think I'd let
that brat Giorno off the hook?!</i>

09:54.810 --> 09:57.145
<i>I'm gonna drag
his sorry ass in here too!</i>

09:57.479 --> 10:01.566
<i>Finally get it now,
Giorno, you piece of shit cazzo?!</i>

10:03.401 --> 10:06.529
<i>As long as one of us
gets back alive, we're good.</i>

10:07.322 --> 10:10.033
<i>Just get back there with you
and the key in one piece…</i>

10:10.659 --> 10:14.954
<i>Nothing matters, but successfully
carrying out the mission.</i>

10:19.334 --> 10:21.669
Hey, Abbacchio.

10:21.837 --> 10:26.337
Think you know what's going on
out there?

10:29.302 --> 10:32.096
If nothing else, at least
you have a loyal partner.

10:32.180 --> 10:36.642
Such a shame, and you tried
so hard to deliver the key…

10:36.726 --> 10:39.270
What do you think's going on
over here?

10:40.480 --> 10:43.399
Nothing at all, my cagacazzo!

10:43.525 --> 10:46.027
Sorry, but that punk is
staying right where he is!

10:46.111 --> 10:49.405
Looks like he's a bit overwhelmed
at the moment.

10:54.369 --> 10:56.746
Giorno, get your ass moving!

10:56.788 --> 10:59.499
Grab that damn key and beat it!

10:59.708 --> 11:03.545
You can scream bloody murder,
he'll never hear you from in here!

11:03.628 --> 11:05.880
Shit, I don't believe it…

11:07.507 --> 11:10.801
Now then, I have two options
at my disposal.

11:11.011 --> 11:15.432
I could secure the key first,
then finish Giorno off later.

11:15.473 --> 11:18.684
Or I could lacerate his trachea
and major arteries,

11:18.727 --> 11:21.479
then collect the key at my leisure.

11:22.439 --> 11:24.649
Let's see…

11:25.859 --> 11:27.443
What the hell,
it's the perfect weather

11:27.485 --> 11:29.445
for opening up that punk's throat!

11:29.946 --> 11:31.697
Somehow he's noticed me.

11:31.823 --> 11:35.284
I'll let in only
Giorno's physical self!

11:38.788 --> 11:40.289
Got another one!

11:40.332 --> 11:42.667
Slice away, Mirror Man!

11:43.460 --> 11:46.129
W-W-What?!

11:46.171 --> 11:48.214
H-He's… That's impossible!

11:48.965 --> 11:51.509
It's the virus! G-Giorno…

11:51.718 --> 11:55.221
He's been infected by
Fugo's Purple Smoke!

11:55.263 --> 11:57.223
The key stays with me, coglione!

11:57.807 --> 12:00.601
Fugo and Abbacchio are
coming back with me too,

12:00.644 --> 12:02.479
and in perfect health!

12:07.234 --> 12:09.277
PANNACOTTA FUGO
PURPLE SMOKE

12:13.448 --> 12:17.948
<i>Giorno Giovanna…
He's an arrogant, ignorant prick!</i>

12:18.370 --> 12:20.497
<i>Purple Smoke
will turn him into human fertilizer</i>

12:20.580 --> 12:22.456
<i>before he knows it!</i>

12:23.583 --> 12:25.418
<i>I'll never forget that day.</i>

12:25.460 --> 12:27.545
<i>A part of me died
in that hellhole.</i>

12:27.629 --> 12:29.672
<i>It left me completely numb.</i>

12:30.465 --> 12:33.885
<i>Losing a limb means
absolutely nothing to me…</i>

12:34.302 --> 12:36.971
<i>The only thing that
brings me solace</i>

12:37.013 --> 12:41.017
<i>is carrying out the orders of
an omnipotent and powerful leader.</i>

12:41.768 --> 12:43.853
<i>I lose myself
in the mania of work.</i>

12:43.937 --> 12:46.356
<i>I become a soldier
devoted to his mission.</i>

12:46.523 --> 12:47.732
<i>Put simply…</i>

12:49.109 --> 12:51.736
<i>My orders were to retrieve
the key and protect the girl.</i>

12:51.820 --> 12:55.365
<i>Carrying out this mission
means everything to me.</i>

12:55.407 --> 12:58.785
<i>And yet Giorno…
That shitty coglione…</i>

12:58.994 --> 13:01.454
<i>Instead of choosing safety
and returning with the key,</i>

13:01.496 --> 13:04.540
<i>he chose danger and decided
to save Fugo and me!</i>

13:04.624 --> 13:06.751
Damn you, you stupid brat!

13:06.835 --> 13:08.670
You brought that dirty disease
in here?!

13:08.920 --> 13:11.672
Are you out of your mind?!

13:14.968 --> 13:18.346
You infected me, you idiot!

13:18.388 --> 13:21.682
Ah, you have the same nasty
symptoms as me.

13:22.225 --> 13:23.893
Purple Smoke's virus

13:23.977 --> 13:27.021
takes about thirty seconds
to infect the entire body.

13:27.063 --> 13:28.939
Your life is over.

13:29.024 --> 13:31.151
The writing was already on the wall

13:31.192 --> 13:33.527
when you decided to pull me
into your mirror world.

13:34.612 --> 13:37.364
The mirror that Purple Smoke
smashed to pieces…

13:38.199 --> 13:39.992
Giorno put them back together?

13:40.118 --> 13:42.120
When the enemy
chased after Abbacchio,

13:42.203 --> 13:44.747
he took some shards with him.

13:44.914 --> 13:46.916
Giorno must've realized that!

13:47.334 --> 13:50.045
That's how he unraveled the mystery
of the enemy's Stand.

13:50.128 --> 13:52.421
He infected himself with the virus,

13:52.505 --> 13:54.673
then allowed himself to be
dragged into the mirror!

13:54.883 --> 13:58.595
There was no other way to
take down that killer!

13:58.678 --> 14:02.640
Damn it!
You calculating cazzo di merda…

14:05.060 --> 14:07.937
Better not get too comfortable.

14:08.063 --> 14:09.564
It's not too late yet.

14:09.647 --> 14:13.108
I just need to steel myself
for battle. This isn't over yet!

14:13.735 --> 14:15.111
Mirror Man!

14:15.195 --> 14:18.406
Allow me and only me to leave
this godforsaken hell hole!

14:22.410 --> 14:25.788
But keep that damn virus contained!

14:25.914 --> 14:30.414
No part of me contaminated with
the virus shall leave!

14:31.002 --> 14:32.003
Merda!

14:32.087 --> 14:34.881
He's going to isolate the virus
inside the mirror world!

14:35.048 --> 14:36.758
If that cocky cagacazzo can

14:36.800 --> 14:39.302
cut off his own damn hand
to get a hold of the key…

14:39.344 --> 14:43.844
Then you better bet your sorry ass
that I'll do the same!

14:44.224 --> 14:48.724
Oh, the glorious pain!

14:48.937 --> 14:50.897
Giorno! Grab him!

14:54.192 --> 14:55.610
He got away…

14:56.403 --> 14:59.322
Giorno… After you…

15:00.031 --> 15:03.784
risked your own life
to come in here…

15:05.537 --> 15:08.581
So he left…
No more mirror world, I guess.

15:13.503 --> 15:15.796
You almost got me there,
but you didn't.

15:15.839 --> 15:17.006
Eat that, assholes!

15:17.090 --> 15:20.426
It's all about…
It's all about mental fortitude!

15:20.593 --> 15:22.469
This is nothing!

15:22.971 --> 15:25.348
I had a hunch he'd leave
his mirror world.

15:25.640 --> 15:27.266
Things are better
than they seem…

15:27.308 --> 15:30.644
He doesn't know it, but his fate
was sealed a long time ago.

15:30.687 --> 15:35.187
By stepping outside his realm
he may have saved my life!

15:35.316 --> 15:39.816
Fugo! Now that he's outside,
Purple Smoke can follow him!

15:40.238 --> 15:41.781
Give him the coup de grâce!

15:43.950 --> 15:45.534
I can't, Giorno.

15:46.244 --> 15:50.414
I can't tell where
he is from inside here.

15:50.874 --> 15:53.751
I have no way to attack him!

15:57.005 --> 15:59.007
I know where he is.

15:59.257 --> 16:01.968
Golden Wind took
the liberty of transforming

16:02.010 --> 16:04.303
that brick outside into a snake.

16:04.637 --> 16:06.180
That's why it's moving.

16:08.391 --> 16:11.310
Snakes can detect infrared
radiation from warm bodies,

16:11.352 --> 16:13.145
human bodies included, of course.

16:36.544 --> 16:37.670
Got him!

16:38.296 --> 16:39.463
What?!

16:39.547 --> 16:42.841
A-After all that mental preparation
to chop off my own arm…

16:42.884 --> 16:45.011
After all the work
to leave my realm…

16:45.053 --> 16:47.013
This… This can't…

16:49.891 --> 16:54.391
S-Stop it! Stop! Damn it!

16:55.396 --> 16:56.480
<i>I'm gonna die…</i>

16:56.564 --> 16:59.858
<i>This death virus capsule
is gonna spill all over me…</i>

17:02.904 --> 17:06.157
<i>Looks like I still have
a little luck by my side!</i>

17:06.241 --> 17:09.494
<i>If Mirror Man
can just catch his punch</i>

17:09.577 --> 17:11.245
<i>for a fraction of a second…</i>

17:11.579 --> 17:13.789
<i>I just need to block it once…</i>

17:13.915 --> 17:16.959
Make him suffer, Purple Smoke!

17:17.126 --> 17:21.088
Mirror Man!
Put this invalid down for good!

17:25.927 --> 17:26.928
I…

17:27.345 --> 17:28.637
<i>I did it…</i>

17:28.680 --> 17:31.891
<i>I stopped it! Now to take
this hunk of flesh back with me…</i>

17:32.100 --> 17:34.185
<i>into my lethal looking glass!</i>

17:35.270 --> 17:36.312
<i>Huh?</i>

17:37.021 --> 17:38.480
<i>What?!</i>

17:40.441 --> 17:43.110
<i>What?!</i>

17:43.152 --> 17:46.947
<i>B-But I blocked its punch…</i>

17:47.198 --> 17:50.534
<i>I was physically
and mentally prepared</i>

17:50.618 --> 17:52.411
<i>top lunge into the real world…</i>

18:22.400 --> 18:25.778
W-We did it! We broke out of
that mirror house hell!

18:25.862 --> 18:28.906
We stamped him out and took care
of his Stand in the process.

18:30.491 --> 18:34.495
B-But Giorno,
Purple Smoke is already circulating

18:34.537 --> 18:36.580
throughout your entire body.

18:37.165 --> 18:38.082
Once you've been infected,

18:38.166 --> 18:40.459
there's not a damn thing
I can do about it.

18:40.585 --> 18:44.880
Yes, Fugo, and it all worked out
for the better.

18:44.922 --> 18:45.923
This…

18:46.674 --> 18:48.008
His decision to leave
his house of mirrors

18:48.051 --> 18:49.552
was the best thing
that could've happened.

18:50.136 --> 18:53.639
Pulling my diseased body into
his mirror realm was, well,

18:53.681 --> 18:55.683
the proverbial nail in the coffin.

18:56.017 --> 18:58.519
His decision to leave behind
the mirror world

18:58.561 --> 19:00.062
and not admit defeat

19:00.104 --> 19:01.730
really was my lucky break.

19:01.773 --> 19:03.399
Fortunately for me,

19:03.524 --> 19:05.859
he recalled his mirror world powers
just before I was about to die,

19:05.902 --> 19:09.530
bringing me face to face
with this friendly snake.

19:09.697 --> 19:11.365
Th-That snake…

19:11.407 --> 19:14.743
That cloud of Purple Smoke's virus
doesn't phase it at all!

19:15.370 --> 19:19.123
I created this snake
from a brick

19:19.207 --> 19:20.958
immersed in
Purple Smoke's viral vapor.

19:21.459 --> 19:23.836
The virus was a part of
his natural habitat,

19:23.878 --> 19:26.338
so he came into
the world disease free.

19:26.756 --> 19:28.382
Get what I'm saying now, amico?

19:29.175 --> 19:32.178
Of course, that snake was born
with a natural immunity.

19:32.261 --> 19:36.098
And if we harvest
the organism's blood and cells…

19:36.140 --> 19:39.643
We can create an antivirus and
stop the disease from spreading!

19:40.228 --> 19:41.938
Golden Wind!

19:42.271 --> 19:44.940
Extract the antiviral serum
from this snake and

19:44.982 --> 19:47.109
inject into my body, pronto!

20:00.707 --> 20:02.917
<i>Giorno Giovanna…</i>

20:03.459 --> 20:06.462
<i>I always thought he was
just an oddball</i>

20:06.504 --> 20:08.130
<i>with his head in the clouds,</i>

20:08.423 --> 20:10.091
<i>but he comes up with
the most harebrained ideas</i>

20:10.133 --> 20:11.509
<i>and actually pulls them off..</i>

20:11.718 --> 20:15.555
<i>There's something about him
that I trust.</i>

20:15.596 --> 20:17.681
<i>It's the kind of trust
you can't put into words.</i>

20:17.765 --> 20:20.851
<i>He has authenticity,
a real genuineness!</i>

20:21.269 --> 20:24.313
<i>You sprang to action,
just like Bucciarati!</i>

20:27.900 --> 20:30.777
Giorno! You placed the lives
of others above your own,

20:30.820 --> 20:32.863
and for that,
you have my eternal respect!

20:34.532 --> 20:36.116
No, Fugo…

20:36.617 --> 20:40.287
I'm not the one
who risked his life.

20:40.413 --> 20:44.375
I simply made a prediction
and acted accordingly.

20:45.334 --> 20:48.962
The one who truly risked
his life here… was Abbacchio.

20:49.046 --> 20:51.673
You know, he sustained
serious injuries back there.

20:52.717 --> 20:57.054
He risked everything to
safeguard that key…

20:57.638 --> 21:01.642
If he hadn't successfully delivered
the key to us here now,

21:02.602 --> 21:04.312
we would have never stood
a chance against that user.

21:04.979 --> 21:08.190
Don't worry about me right now…
He needs urgent help.

21:08.232 --> 21:09.233
Giorno!

21:10.067 --> 21:11.902
Are you okay, Giorno?!

21:14.071 --> 21:16.198
Damn it, Giorno…

21:16.324 --> 21:17.908
I was going…

21:18.451 --> 21:21.203
to beat the shit out of you…

21:21.996 --> 21:25.374
But with my hand like this,
I guess I can't.

21:25.458 --> 21:29.044
Your ass kicking can wait,
for now…

21:31.923 --> 21:34.675
<i>In the end,
the team got their key!</i>

23:37.965 --> 23:41.677
EPISODE 14
IL TRENO ESPRESSO PER FIRENZE
